  "salt": "JTTLK9S-C1Mx2WVLAhlXIw==",
  "text": "Fire returns to the ancient fire-temple at Kildare. Restoration in the 1980s uncovered the temple within the Protestant cathedral grounds. Vigils at the well of Brigit continue. Ceremonial events and works make up La Fáile Bhrude, the feast of Brigit, in Kildare. Beyond Kildare the goddess and the saint fused even more firmly. February 1, the festival of Brigit the goddess, also keeps the day that belongs to the saint.",
